        "smithy.api#http": {
          "method": "PUT",
          "uri": "/zones/{zone_id}/precursor",
          "code": 200
        },
        "smithy.api#documentation": "Updates the Precursor configuration for a zone. `mode` controls whether Precursor detection is off, monitoring, or armed. `show_interstitial` controls the zone-level response when armed. `rules` is the ordered list of overrides for matching requests. This is a partial update: only the fields present in the request body are changed. - Sending an empty array ( `[]`) clears all rules. - At least one of `mode`, `show_interstitial`, or `rules` must be present; an empty body ( `{}`) is rejected with `400`. - Rule `id` is read-only (assigned by Cloudflare) and ignored on input. - Rule `show_interstitial` is required and controls the response for requests that match that rule. - Rule `expression` is limited to 4000 characters. The limit applies to each rule individually, not to the combined size of all rules.",
